  "notes": "Corrected Stage C v6 / Stage D v3 hidden-safe inference version 4 completed and submit-check passed. Competition submission ref 54818932 scored Public LB 7.562 and updates the ML-route LB anchor from exp274 7.715 by -0.153; it also beats the separate exp082 ensemble anchor 7.601 by -0.039. The duplicate automatic run record ref 54818883 also scored 7.562. The worst-well guard failure remains retained, so this is an LB anchor but not a train-side adoption. Route classification was corrected to ml_model because PF/HMM/Beam candidates are auxiliary selector meta features and the downstream LightGBM generates the final prediction; direct blend, hard path, Viterbi, and softmax TVT averaging are excluded. OOF diagnostics were authorized on 2026-07-19. Selector version 1 failed on row-order alignment; version 2 fixed ID alignment and completed 773 plots, but its plots were invalidated because they changed the exp238 visual contract and omitted the HMM 2-sigma band. Corrected selector version 3 completed and was verified on all 773 wells with the exact exp238 plot structure, reference paths, colors, and exact-HMM 2-sigma band. LikPF version 1 completed 128-seed replay for all 773 wells with exact saved-mean parity and maximum absolute difference 0. Both diagnostics generated 773 plots and no model fit, blend, or submission."
